FTP: the FTP client, without FTP over SSL (no OpenSSL);
php84-ftp-openssl has it.

The module ftp of PHP 8.4 for php84 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20240924/ftp.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php84/conf.d, its headers in
include/php84/php/ext/ftp.
